Dear [PERSON_1],

As a public body we have to follow a formal procurement process. Your proposal must:

- Price the system, installation and five years of maintenance separately.
- Confirm that the system meets our information security standard and that all data stays
  within the country.
- Provide the system with accessible screens for staff with visual impairments.
- Include a business continuity plan: the hospitals must still receive supplies if the
  automation stops for a full day.
- Show expected energy consumption per year.

Our evaluation committee has not yet fixed the weighting between price and quality.

Kind regards,
[PERSON_5]
